{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/extras/play-banner.gif?t=1747016338\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DINO MAYHEM!</strong><br>Get your claws out and leave a (massive) footprint in this legendary Dino game! Rampage through cities and sink your teeth into destruction by chomping down on buildings, animals, and all the bipeds that get in your way. Level up your apex status with modern tech like jetpacks and laser guns to bring down your enemies at Dyno-Tech Corporation. Sure, they made you, but they can never control you. Mayhem has never tasted this T-Riffic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DESTROY</strong> buildings and level cites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EAT</strong> humans and other creatures to regain health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT</strong> your way through the forces of the evil company, Dyno-Tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WIELD</strong> high-tech weapons to cause mayhem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RESCUE</strong> other dinosaurs to help you on your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNLOCK</strong> a variety of colorful new skins for your dinos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4-PLAYER</strong> local co-op.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2614930?t=1747016338","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2614930?t=1747016338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747016338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747016338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-playe